<title>RUSSIA: Russian Chelyabenergo shares up 15 pct.</title>
<headline>Russian Chelyabenergo shares up 15 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Russian regional power utility Chelyabenergo rose 15 percent to $0.770 at 0937 GMT on the Russian Trading System on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Traders said there were no rumours or company news behind the move from $0.670 at the previous close but one suggested a single large order of the illiquid shares could push up the price quickly.</p>
<p>Just under $500,000 had turned over in about two and a half hours of trade.</p>
<p>--Peter Henderson, Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
